      "skos:note": "Gene Technology Regulator must provide written advice to NRA upon request.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000#sch-1-sec-8a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8A(4) Consultation with Gene Technology Regulator",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the NRA gives the Gene Technology Regulator a notice under\nsubsection (3), the Gene Technology Regulator may give written\nadvice to the NRA about the application, reconsideration, or issue."
    },
