    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000-sch-1-sec-8a-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8A(6) Consultation with Gene Technology Regulator",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000#sch-1-sec-8a-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the NRA receives advice from the Gene Technology Regulator\nin response to a notice under this section within the period\nspecified in the notice, the NRA must:\n\n(a) ensure that the advice is taken into account in making a\ndecision on the application, reconsideration, or issue to which\nthe notice relates; and\n\n(b) inform the Gene Technology Regulator of the decision.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If the NRA receives advice from the Gene Technology Regulator\nin response to a notice under this section within the period\nspecified in the notice, the NRA must:\n\n(a) ensure that the advice is taken into account in making a\ndecision on the application, reconsideration, or issue to which\nthe notice relates; and\n\n(b) inform the Gene Technology Regulator of the decision.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000-sch-1-sec-8a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000-sch-1-sec-8a-ss-6-norm"
        },
