      "skos:definition": "(7) Unless the contrary intention appears, expressions used in this\nsection have the same meanings as in the Agricultural and\nVeterinary Chemicals Code Act 1994.\n\nConsequential amendments  Schedule 1\n\nAgricultural and Veterinary Chemicals Code Act 1994",
