      "values:originalText": "(2) Subject to subsection (5), the Director must give written notice to\nthe Gene Technology Regulator:\n\n(a) stating that the assessment is to be undertaken, or that the\napplication for the permit has been made, as the case\nrequires; and\n\n(b) requesting the Gene Technology Regulator to give advice\nabout the assessment or the application for the permit."
