      "skos:definition": "(1) The Director may request advice from the Gene Technology\nRegulator in relation to industrial chemicals that consist of, or that\n\nSchedule 1  Consequential amendments\n\ncontain, a GM product belonging to a class of GM products\nspecified in the request.",
