    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000-sch-1-sec-30c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "30C Consultation with Gene Technology Regulator",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000#sch-1-sec-30c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to an application for listing or registration of a\ntherapeutic good under section 23 if the therapeutic good is, or\ncontains, a GM product.\n\n(2) Subject to subsection (5), the Secretary must give written notice to\nthe Gene Technology Regulator:\n\n(a) stating that the application has been made; and\n\n(b) requesting the Gene Technology Regulator to give advice\nabout the application.\n\n(3) If the Secretary gives the Gene Technology Regulator a notice\nunder subsection (2), the Gene Technology Regulator may give\nwritten advice to the Secretary about the application.\n\n(4) The advice is to be given within the period specified in the notice.\n\n(5) If an advice from the Gene Technology Regulator is in force under\nsection 30D in relation to a class of therapeutic goods, the\nSecretary is not required to notify the Regulator under this section\nin relation to an application for listing or registration of a\ntherapeutic good belonging to that class.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies to an application for listing or registration of a\ntherapeutic good under section 23 if the therapeutic good is, or\ncontains, a GM product.\n\n(2) Subject to subsection (5), the Secretary must give written notice to\nthe Gene Technology Regulator:\n\n(a) stating that the application has been made; and\n\n(b) requesting the Gene Technology Regulator to give advice\nabout the application.\n\n(3) If the Secretary gives the Gene Technology Regulator a notice\nunder subsection (2), the Gene Technology Regulator may give\nwritten advice to the Secretary about the application.\n\n(4) The advice is to be given within the period specified in the notice.\n\n(5) If an advice from the Gene Technology Regulator is in force under\nsection 30D in relation to a class of therapeutic goods, the\nSecretary is not required to notify the Regulator under this section\nin relation to an application for listing or registration of a\ntherapeutic good belonging to that class.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000-sch-1-sec-30c-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000-sch-1-sec-30c-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000-sch-1-sec-30c-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000-sch-1-sec-30c-ss-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000-sch-1-sec-30c-ss-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6bc9f9cc6549ff44901f3a598b03fcc4a2a7c7c02e7733df3fdd8b362ad1a391"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000#sch-1-sec-30c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "30C Consultation with Gene Technology Regulator",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 13,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to an application for listing or registration of a\ntherapeutic good under section 23 if the therapeutic good is, or\ncontains, a GM product.\n\n(2) Subject to subsection (5), the Secretary must give written notice to\nthe Gene Technology Regulator:\n\n(a) stating that the application has been made; and\n\n(b) requesting the Gene Technology Regulator to give advice\nabout the application.\n\n(3) If the Secretary gives the Gene Technology Regulator a notice\nunder subsection (2), the Gene Technology Regulator may give\nwritten advice to the Secretary about the application.\n\n(4) The advice is to be given within the period specified in the notice.\n\n(5) If an advice from the Gene Technology Regulator is in force under\nsection 30D in relation to a class of therapeutic goods, the\nSecretary is not required to notify the Regulator under this section\nin relation to an application for listing or registration of a\ntherapeutic good belonging to that class."
    },
