          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000-sch-1-sec-30d-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000-sch-1-sec-30d-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2fe027cec6dac4534a3352fab9e417bee5b6d8e2f9cbbef87e72de4a0e43dafd",
      "skos:note": "Advice remains in force until withdrawn by the Gene Technology Regulator."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000#sch-1-sec-30d-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "30D(4) Secretary may seek advice about classes of GM products",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 13,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the Gene Technology Regulator gives advice to the Secretary\nunder subsection (3), the advice remains in force until it is\nwithdrawn by the Gene Technology Regulator by written notice\ngiven to the Secretary."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000-sch-1-sec-30d-ss-4-norm",
